Plan: 2026-05-08-002-feat-skill-applicability-v0
Journey: skill-author-self-declares-applicability
Evidence marker: external-cli-provenance-no-invoke.log

F002 supports inert external_cli metadata in applies_to frontmatter.
When a matching skill declares external_cli, the matcher copies
provider/name/command/version_pin into the Match and sets
provenance='external'.

Verification was captured by TestExternalProvenance in
scripts/dontpanic_orchestrate/tests/test_skill_applicability.py:

- valid external_cli metadata passes through to the report.
- external provenance is recorded without install, invoke, allowlist, hash,
  score, or live CLI validation.
- TestPurity verifies skill_applicability.py contains no subprocess,
  logging.getLogger, or print() execution surface.

This preserves the Printing Press adapter hook while keeping v0 advisory
and non-executing.
